   <div>This is bullshit.</div><div><br></div><div>1) The focus on Kelly is=
 bizarre. Evie passes a dozen people upon entering the building including K=
elly. Her exclusion is simply designed to harm me.&nbsp;</div><div><br></di=
v><div>2) The sausage feeding of Evie is not true. There were strawberries =
on the plate and sausages. Evie got strawberries while Dad ate the bacon an=
d sausages. Evie only ate a crumb of bacon. &nbsp;But whatever.</div><div><=
br></div><div>3) The bruise on the shin situation is exactly the reverse. W=
e documented two dark purple bruise areas that were clearly sustained previ=
sit. &nbsp;Bruises like this don't form during a visit and there is no reco=
rd in the report of any fall that would have caused. For her to write this =
with a straight face is crazy.</div><div><br></div><div>We can't go along w=
ith anything they suggest.</div><div><br></div><div>Steve</div> <div><br></=
div><div><br></div>On Tue, Apr 16, 2019 at 6:55 AM, Darren Enenstein &lt;<a=
 href=3D"mailto:dse@enensteinlaw.com" class=3D"">dse@enensteinlaw.com</a>&g=
t; wrote:<blockquote class=3D"protonmail_quote" type=3D"cite">




Email from Ms. Jackman is below.&nbsp;<br>
