<br>
</div>
<blockquote type=3D"cite">
<div dir=3D"ltr"><b>From:</b> Jennifer Jackman &lt;<a href=3D"mailto:jmj@mz=
w-law.com">jmj@mzw-law.com</a>&gt;<br>
<b>Date:</b> April 16, 2019 at 5:39:41 AM PDT<br>
<b>To:</b> Darren Enenstein &lt;<a href=3D"mailto:dse@enensteinlaw.com">dse=
